{
  "_comment": ["How useful each pick-list line is in a nuzlocke of Oxide, one letter per", "line (S, A, B, C, D), keyed by the line id the tool uses (dex.lines).", "A first draft by the encounter track (2026-09-26) from the lines' final", "forms: their standing in each generation's nuzlocke tier lists and", "Smogon tiers, read for single-player story play. Ian's to correct; the", "box simulator mixes it with BST and the pick-list tier (simulate.py)."],
  "_wanted_comment": ["Ian's super-wanted lines (2026-09-26), by a member of each: Vulpix, Ponyta, Koffing,", "Eevee, Togepi, Articuno (Kanto only), Suicune, Ralts, Skitty, Roselia, Swablu, Milotic,", "Froslass, Buneary, Drapion, Cresselia, Florges, Primarina, Tsareena, Pheromosa, Cinderace,", "Corviknight, Meloetta. A majority should land in a run; they may stay near-guaranteed and", "are never trimmed, and their legendaries are the ones kept when the strong ones go. The", "regional Vulpix, Ponyta and Koffing count too, and Ian prefers them; Meloetta is not in", "the species tree yet. The simulator plays towards them (simulate.py, WANTED_BONUS)."],
